  "description": "In a remote kingdom in the desert, Karik, a trait education specialist and Beta tutor, has been teaching Prince Nasran, the third prince, to behave like a “flawlessly outstanding Alpha.” However, the Sultan suddenly issues an order to re-educate the Third Prince as an Omega for a political marriage with a foreign nation. To a bewildered Nasran, Karik proposes to provide him with “special training” so that he can at least maintain the dignity befitting royalty… \n\n“If you trust me, I will help you become the most perfect Omega starting today.”\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapter.*",
